    "title": "SG-61",
    "description": "The SG-61 is a digital dial for Wear OS from SGWatchDesign.\r\n\r\nBuy one get one! OFFER\r\n\r\nOnly for Wear OS device API 30+\r\n\r\nFunctions\r\n\r\n\u2022 12/24 hour time (adapts to the connected phone)\r\n\u2022 Date multilingual\r\n\u2022 high resolution\r\n\u2022 Energy -efficient\r\n\r\n\r\nFor the full range of functions, please activate the authorization \"sensors\" manually!\r\n\r\nThe telephone app only serves as a placeholder to simplify the installation and finding the dial on your Wear OS watch. You have to select your watch device from the dropdown menu\r\n\r\nPlease send all problem reports or help inquiries to our support address\r\nsgwatchdesign@gmail.com",
